@startuml Webhook Processing Flow
!theme plain

title Webhook Processing with Idempotency

participant "Stripe API" as STRIPE
participant "WebhookController" as WHC
participant "SignatureVerifier" as SV
participant "WebhookProcessor" as WHP
participant "IdempotencyChecker" as IC
participant "WebhookLogRepository" as WLR
participant "ContractRepository" as CR
participant "EventDispatcher" as ED
participant "Event Handlers" as EH
database "Database" as DB

== Webhook Received ==

STRIPE -> WHC: POST /webhook\n(payload, signature header)
activate WHC

WHC -> SV: verify(payload, signature)
activate SV

SV -> SV: Extract signature\nfrom header
SV -> SV: Stripe\\Webhook::\nconstructEvent(\n  payload, signature, secret)

alt Signature Valid
    SV --> WHC: true
    deactivate SV
else Signature Invalid
    SV --> WHC: throws PaymentAdapterException
    WHC --> STRIPE: 401 Unauthorized\n{'error': 'Invalid signature'}
    deactivate WHC
end

== Parse Webhook Event ==

WHC -> WHP: process(webhookData:\n  ['event_id' => 'evt_xxx',\n   'event_type' => 'payment_intent.succeeded',\n   'data' => [...]])
activate WHP

WHP -> WHP: validateWebhookData(data)

WHP -> IC: isProcessed('evt_xxx')
activate IC

IC -> IC: Check in-memory cache
IC -> WLR: existsByEventId('evt_xxx')
activate WLR

WLR -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM osc_payment_webhook_log\nWHERE OXEVENTID = 'evt_xxx'
DB --> WLR: 0 (not found)
WLR --> IC: false
deactivate WLR

IC --> WHP: false (not processed)
deactivate IC

== Find Associated Contract ==

WHP -> WHP: extractPaymentIntentId(data)
note right: Extracts 'pi_xxx'\nfrom event data

WHP -> CR: findByProviderOrderId('pi_xxx')
activate CR

CR -> DB: SELECT *\nFROM osc_payment_contract\nWHERE OXPROVIDERORDERID = 'pi_xxx'
DB --> CR: Contract record
CR --> WHP: PaymentContract
deactivate CR

== Dispatch Webhook Event ==

WHP -> ED: dispatch(\n  WebhookReceivedEvent(\n    eventId: 'evt_xxx',\n    eventType: 'payment_intent.succeeded',\n    contractId: 'contract_123',\n    eventData: [...]))
activate ED

ED -> EH: handle(WebhookReceivedEvent)
activate EH

note over EH
    Handlers process event
    based on event type:
    - payment_intent.succeeded
    - payment_intent.payment_failed
    - charge.refunded
    - etc.
end note

EH -> EH: Process webhook logic\n(update contract state,\n dispatch follow-up events)

EH --> ED: event handled
deactivate EH

ED --> WHP: event dispatched
deactivate ED

== Mark as Processed ==

WHP -> IC: markAsProcessed('evt_xxx')
activate IC

IC -> IC: Add to in-memory cache\nprocessedEvents['evt_xxx'] = true

IC -> WLR: save(WebhookLog(\n  eventId: 'evt_xxx',\n  status: 'processed',\n  eventType: 'payment_intent.succeeded',\n  contractId: 'contract_123'))
activate WLR

WLR -> DB: INSERT INTO\nosc_payment_webhook_log\n(OXID, OXEVENTID, OXSTATUS,\n OXEVENTTYPE, OXCONTRACTID,\n OXRECEIVEDAT)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, NOW())
DB --> WLR: success
WLR --> IC: void
deactivate WLR

IC --> WHP: void
deactivate IC

WHP --> WHC: void
deactivate WHP

WHC --> STRIPE: 200 OK\n{'status': 'processed'}
deactivate WHC

== Duplicate Webhook (Idempotency Check) ==

note over STRIPE
    Stripe retries webhook
    with same event ID
end note

STRIPE -> WHC: POST /webhook\n(same payload, evt_xxx)
activate WHC

WHC -> SV: verify(payload, signature)
activate SV
SV --> WHC: true (valid)
deactivate SV

WHC -> WHP: process(webhookData:\n  ['event_id' => 'evt_xxx', ...])
activate WHP

WHP -> IC: isProcessed('evt_xxx')
activate IC

IC -> IC: Check in-memory cache
note right of IC: Found in cache:\nprocessedEvents['evt_xxx'] = true

IC --> WHP: true (already processed)
deactivate IC

WHP --> WHC: void (skipped silently)
deactivate WHP

WHC --> STRIPE: 200 OK\n{'status': 'already_processed'}
deactivate WHC

note over DB
    **Webhook Log Table:**
    OXID: log_abc123
    OXEVENTID: evt_xxx (UNIQUE)
    OXSTATUS: processed
    OXEVENTTYPE: payment_intent.succeeded
    OXCONTRACTID: contract_123
    OXRECEIVEDAT: 2025-11-07 10:35:00
    OXERROR: null
end note

== Error Handling ==

STRIPE -> WHC: POST /webhook\n(malformed payload)
activate WHC

WHC -> SV: verify(payload, signature)
activate SV
SV --> WHC: true (signature valid)
deactivate SV

WHC -> WHP: process(webhookData)
activate WHP

WHP -> WHP: validateWebhookData(data)
note right: Validation fails:\nmissing event_id

WHP -> WLR: save(WebhookLog(\n  eventId: 'unknown',\n  status: 'failed',\n  error: 'Missing event_id'))
activate WLR
WLR -> DB: INSERT with status='failed'
WLR --> WHP: void
deactivate WLR

WHP --> WHC: throws exception
deactivate WHP

WHC -> WHC: Log error
WHC --> STRIPE: 400 Bad Request\n{'error': 'Invalid webhook data'}
deactivate WHC

note over WHP
    **Idempotency Benefits:**
    1. Prevents duplicate processing
    2. Handles Stripe retries gracefully
    3. In-memory cache for performance
    4. Database for persistence
    5. Audit trail for debugging
end note

@enduml
